From 21fd430f50e0e11a98f92df2f0a3c8197011f4a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Jelen <jjelen@redhat.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:26:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Verify source signatures with openpgpverify

Replace the direct GnuPG verification with %openpgpverify, which
uses Sequoia sqv, as part of the Fedora 45 Change
https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Sequoia_openpgpverify

Refresh keysuv.gpg from keyservers/WKD: same certificate(s), with self-
signatures our copy was missing.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 keysuv.gpg | Bin 23079 -> 42607 bytes
 libuv.spec |   3 ++-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

